nt-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS5Ze7CksOAyoYGr05XonqNeb9VhOna7g9tPvOplodnEA&oe=6B0704B3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Baboon Hub", "keywords": ["tag", "gorilla", "fangame", "baboonhub"], "long_description": "Step into a fun and immersive multiplayer experience where movement, exploration, and interaction are at the core of the gameplay. Explore a dynamic map filled with different areas to discover, each offering new opportunities and experiences every time you play.\n\nEnjoy smooth and engaging movement that allows you to run, jump, and navigate the world freely. Whether you're exploring on your own or playing with others, the game creates a fast-paced and interactive environment where anything can happen.\n\nMeet and interact with other players, take part in exciting moments, and experience a constantly evolving world with regular updates and new features. The game is designed to be both social and competitive, giving players the freedom to play however they like.\n\nCustomize your character with a range of cosmetics, show off your style, and stand out in the community. With more content, systems, and improvements planned for the future, there will always be something new to look forward to.\n\nJoin the game, explore the world, and become part of a growing community built around fun, creativity, and interaction.", "short_description": "A fun movement-based multiplayer game where players run, jump, and interact in a social and competitive world."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/baboonhubvr/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Myst", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/baboonhubvr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "4597